#. Announced when a link could not be opened. {link} is the link.
msgid "Could not open {link}"
msgstr "No se pudo abrir {link}"

#. Asks before opening many links. {count} is the number of links.
msgid "Open {count} links?"
msgstr "¿Abrir {count} enlaces?"

#. Title of the question that asks before opening many links.
#. Category of the add-on's command in the Input gestures dialog.
#. Title of the add-on's panel in NVDA settings.
msgid "Simple Link Opener"
msgstr "Simple Link Opener"

#. Announced when one link is opened.
msgid "Opening link"
msgstr "Abriendo enlace"

#. Announced when several links are opened. {count} is the number of links.
msgid "Opening {count} links"
msgstr "Abriendo {count} enlaces"

#. Announced when the clipboard has links, but their kind is turned off in the settings.
msgid "The links in the clipboard are of a kind turned off in the settings"
msgstr "Los enlaces del portapapeles son de un tipo desactivado en la configuración"

#. Announced when the clipboard has no link to open.
msgid "No link in clipboard"
msgstr "No hay ningún enlace en el portapapeles"

#. Announced when the clipboard has several links. {count} is the number of links.
msgid "{count} links"
msgstr "{count} enlaces"

#. Describes the command in the Input gestures dialog.
msgid ""
"Pressed once, says the link in the clipboard, or how many links there are. "
"Pressed twice, opens the link, "
"or shows a list to open one or all of the links."
msgstr ""
"Pulsado una vez, dice el enlace del portapapeles, o cuántos enlaces hay. "
"Pulsado dos veces, abre el enlace, "
"o muestra una lista para abrir uno o todos los enlaces."

#. Label of the group of checkboxes that choose which kinds of links are opened.
msgid "Kinds of links to open"
msgstr "Tipos de enlaces que se abren"

#. Checkbox for links that start with http://
msgid "Links starting with &http://"
msgstr "Enlaces que empiezan por &http://"

#. Checkbox for links that start with https://
msgid "Links starting with http&s://"
msgstr "Enlaces que empiezan por http&s://"

#. Checkbox for links that start with www. without http:// or https:// in front.
msgid "Links starting with &www., such as www.example.com"
msgstr "Enlaces que empiezan por &www., como www.example.com"

#. Checkbox for TeamTalk links, which start with tt://
msgid "&TeamTalk links starting with tt://"
msgstr "Enlaces de &TeamTalk que empiezan por tt://"

#. Title of the dialog that lists the links found in the clipboard.
msgid "Links in clipboard"
msgstr "Enlaces del portapapeles"

#. Label of the list of links in the clipboard.
msgid "&Links:"
msgstr "&Enlaces:"

#. Button that opens the selected link.
msgid "&Open"
msgstr "&Abrir"

#. Button that opens every link in the list. {count} is the number of links.
msgid "Open {count} links"
msgstr "Abrir {count} enlaces"

#. Button that closes the dialog without opening anything.
msgid "&Close"
msgstr "&Cerrar"
